# One line-ending story on every OS: LF in the repo AND in the working tree.
# Windows checkouts used to carry CRLF (core.autocrlf), so a one-character
# edit showed up as a whole-file diff that hid the real change. `eol=lf`
# overrides core.autocrlf / core.eol for every text file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalise, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
